description	"Mandalorian Legend

Pick between a high ranking Mandalorian Warlord, or an Ex Mandolorian Duelist (Bendak Starkiller).

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Bendak's Blaster Pistol (Pistol 3)
-- Knocks Down
-- Mag Reload
-- 30%+ Damage, 20%+ FP Drain
-- 20%+ RoF
-- 10%+ Velocity
- Vibrosword (Saber Defense 1)
-- Red Style

^8Attributes:
- Beskar (2)
- Strength (1)
- Blast Armor
- Tracking Beacon
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)

^3Abilities:
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS4]
- Stimpack ^3[CS2]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]"